---
description: Compare multilingual occurrences by meaning and context, retaining disputed boundaries.
args: { dossier: TerminologyDossier; change: TerminologyChange; occurrences: TermOccurrence[] }
returns: SenseCluster[]
---
For each occurrence pair, compare definitions, referents, product context, regional guidance and expert opinions. Group only when evidence supports the same concept. Record the feature that separates each candidate meaning. Preserve incompatible expert definitions as a disputed boundary and request a resolving example or decision from the authorized terminology owner.
